      "threshold": 0.5,
      "confidence": 0.78,
      "source": "manual",
      "created": "2026-05-11",
      "note": "量比>0.5时表示市场仍有买入力量，做空风险高。量能萎缩才是真正的反转迹象。",
      "win_rate_before": null,
      "win_rate_after": null,
      "trigger_count": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "gainers_list_long_bias",
      "name": "涨幅榜+高量比信号优先做多",
      "type": "redirect",
      "direction": "SHORT",
      "condition": "signal_type == gainers_list AND funding_rate < -0.001 AND vol_ratio > 1.5",
      "threshold": null,
      "redirect_to": "LONG",
      "confidence": 0.72,
      "source": "manual",
      "created": "2026-05-11",
      "note": "涨幅榜信号中，FR小负值+高量比往往是多头动能延续，而非见顶。强制转为LONG方向候选。",
      "win_rate_before": null,
      "win_rate_after": null,
      "trigger_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "rsi_1d_80_half_position",
      "name": "日线RSI>80时做空仓位强制减半",
      "type": "position_limit",
      "direction": "SHORT",
      "condition": "rsi_1d > threshold",
      "threshold": 80,
      "position_multiplier": 0.5,
